{"format":"hologram.registry.artifact/v1","id":"mcr.microsoft.com/azure-cognitive-services/vision/spatial-analysis","fetched":"2026-09-25T12:12:03.018Z","source":{"name":"Microsoft Artifact Registry","api":"https://mcr.microsoft.com/api/v1/catalog/azure-cognitive-services/vision/spatial-analysis/details?reg=mar","page":"https://mcr.microsoft.com/en-us/product/azure-cognitive-services/vision/spatial-analysis/about"},"readme":"## About\n\n[Azure AI services](http://aka.ms/cognitive-services) is a set of APIs, SDKs and container images that enables developers to integrate ready-made AI directly into their applications. Azure AI services contains a broad set of capabilities including text analytics; facial detection, speech and vision recognition; natural language understanding, and more.\n\nContainer support in Azure AI services allows developers to use the same rich APIs that are available in Azure but with the flexibility that comes with containers. See [Container support in Azure AI services](http://aka.ms/cognitive-services-containers) for details.\n\n[Spatial Analysis](https://azure.microsoft.com/services/cognitive-services/computer-vision) on real-time video offers the ability to understand people’s movements in a physical space, significantly increasing efficiency and resolution of customer data. Developers, enterprise solution providers, and customers with development capabilities spatial analysis operations to build edge or cloud solutions, with no Machine Learning experience required.\n\n## Featured tags\n\n- `latest`\ndocker pull mcr.microsoft.com/azure-cognitive-services/vision/spatial-analysis\n\n## Related repositories\n\n+ [Azure AI services Images](https://hub.docker.com/_/microsoft-azure-cognitive-services): Azure AI services is a set of APIs, SDKs and container images that enables developers to integrate ready-made AI directly into their applications.\n\n## Configuration\n\nSee the [configuration documentation](https://go.microsoft.com/fwlink/?linkid=2140366) for how to configure this image.\n\n## Usage\n\nSee the [How-to](https://go.microsoft.com/fwlink/?linkid=2140537) for how to use this image.\n\n## Related Information\n\n+ [Azure AI Vision Azure Cognitive Service](https://azure.microsoft.com/services/cognitive-services/computer-vision)\n+ [Container Support in Azure AI services](http://aka.ms/cognitive-services-containers)\n+ [Azure AI services](http://aka.ms/cognitive-services)\n+ [Azure Portal](http://portal.azure.com)\n\n## Support\n\nReport feedback or issues on [Stack Overflow](https://go.microsoft.com/fwlink/?linkid=2056278) using tag azure-cognitive-services.\n\n## License\n\n- Legal Notice: [Container License Information](https://aka.ms/mcr/osslegalnotice)\n\n\nThis Preview is made available to you on the condition that you agree to the [Supplemental Terms of Use for Microsoft Azure Previews](https://go.microsoft.com/fwlink/?linkid=2018815&clcid=0x409), which supplement [your agreement](https://go.microsoft.com/fwlink/?linkid=2018657&clcid=0x409) governing your use of Azure. If you do not have an existing agreement governing your use of Azure, you agree that your agreement governing use of Azure is the [Microsoft Online Subscription Agreement](https://go.microsoft.com/fwlink/?linkid=2018755&clcid=0x409) (which incorporates the [Online Services Terms](https://go.microsoft.com/fwlink/?linkid=2018760&clcid=0x409)). By using the Preview you agree to these terms.","readmeBase":null,"publisher":{"name":"Microsoft","url":"https://mcr.microsoft.com/","official":true,"verified":true},"registered":null,"updated":"2025-04-21T15:33:33.7855561+00:00","categories":[],"keywords":[],"license":"Other","links":[{"name":"licence","url":"https://www.microsoft.com/licensing/terms/product/ForOnlineServices/EAEAS"}],"maintainers":[],"stats":{"pulls":null,"pullsText":"112K+","stars":null},"mediaTypes":[],"contentTypes":[],"storage":null,"tags":[{"name":"1.9.1","digest":"sha256:f5ab001544c49a4e8cbe1855bbdb59dbcb200e6ce3dd62